221
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:36,640
So, what are some simple and professional ways to start a conversation?

222
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,480
One easy phrase is,

223
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,440
Hi, do you have a moment?

224
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,760
That's very polite and natural.

225
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,020
Another one is,

226
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:46,180
can I quickly ask you something?

227
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:47,260
I like that one.

228
00:10:47,260 --> 00:10:50,160
