229
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,480
You can also say,

230
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:54,080
I just wanted to check something with you.

231
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:56,160
That sounds very professional.

232
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:58,040
Let's do a quick example.

233
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:58,880
Okay.

234
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,720
