787
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:49,400
You can say, I just wanted to give you a quick update.

788
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:52,000
Or, here's the latest update.

789
00:34:52,000 --> 00:34:54,480
Or, we're making good progress.

790
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,640
Example.

791
00:34:55,640 --> 00:34:57,720
I just wanted to give you a quick update.

792
00:34:57,720 --> 00:34:59,640
The project is on track.

793
00:34:59,640 --> 00:35:00,360
Great.

794
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:03,160
Now let's talk about handling problems.

795
00:35:03,160 --> 00:35:06,680
Yes, this is where communication becomes critical.

796
00:35:06,680 --> 00:35:10,040
you can say, we've encountered an issue.

797
00:35:10,040 --> 00:35:12,640
Or there seems to be a problem.

798
00:35:12,640 --> 00:35:14,800
Then follow with a solution.

799
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:16,320
We're working on it.

800
00:35:16,320 --> 00:35:19,760
Example, we've encountered an issue with the system,

801
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:21,840
but we're working on resolving it.

802
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,520
Very professional.

803
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:25,840
Now let's talk about meetings.

804
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:28,720
To start, say, let's get started.

805
00:35:28,720 --> 00:35:31,160
Or thank you all for joining.

806
00:35:31,160 --> 00:35:34,760
To move on, say, let's move to the next point.

807
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:37,700
to end, say, let's wrap up.

808
00:35:37,700 --> 00:35:39,100
Quick role play.

809
00:35:39,100 --> 00:35:40,260
Good morning, everyone.

810
00:35:40,260 --> 00:35:41,700
Let's get started.

811
00:35:41,700 --> 00:35:44,220
First, let's discuss the budget.

812
00:35:44,220 --> 00:35:46,500
Now let's move on to marketing.

813
00:35:46,500 --> 00:35:47,420
Let's wrap up.

814
00:35:47,420 --> 00:35:48,620
Thanks, everyone.

815
00:35:48,620 --> 00:35:49,620
Perfect.

816
00:35:49,620 --> 00:35:51,460
Now emails.

817
00:35:51,460 --> 00:35:54,340
Start with, I hope you're doing well.

818
00:35:54,340 --> 00:35:57,140
Or I'm writing regarding.

819
00:35:57,140 --> 00:36:00,300
And with, looking forward to your response.

820
00:36:00,300 --> 00:36:02,460
Or best regards.

821
00:36:02,460 --> 00:36:04,100
Now feedback.

822
00:36:04,100 --> 00:36:05,980
Start positive.

823
00:36:05,980 --> 00:36:08,140
Then suggest improvement.

824
00:36:08,140 --> 00:36:09,260
Example.

825
00:36:09,260 --> 00:36:10,700
You did a great job.

826
00:36:10,700 --> 00:36:13,980
One thing to improve could be time management.

827
00:36:13,980 --> 00:36:14,940
Excellent.

828
00:36:14,940 --> 00:36:17,460
Now let's do a longer role play.

829
00:36:17,460 --> 00:36:18,380
Let's go.

830
00:36:18,380 --> 00:36:19,220
Hi, Daniel.

831
00:36:19,220 --> 00:36:20,460
Do you have a minute?

832
00:36:20,460 --> 00:36:20,960
Sure.

833
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:21,940
What's up?

834
00:36:21,940 --> 00:36:24,980
I wanted to discuss the project timeline.

835
00:36:24,980 --> 00:36:25,540
OK.

836
00:36:25,540 --> 00:36:26,740
What do you think?

837
00:36:26,740 --> 00:36:29,380
I think we might need more time.

838
00:36:29,380 --> 00:36:32,660
I see your point, but the deadline is tight.

839
00:36:32,660 --> 00:36:33,660
That's true.

840
00:36:33,660 --> 00:36:36,260
Maybe we can adjust priorities.

841
00:36:36,260 --> 00:36:38,020
That sounds like a good idea.

842
00:36:38,020 --> 00:36:40,180
Could you help me review the plan?

843
00:36:40,180 --> 00:36:41,220
Of course.

844
00:36:41,220 --> 00:36:43,100
Thanks, I appreciate it.

845
00:36:43,100 --> 00:36:45,140
That was very realistic.

846
00:36:45,140 --> 00:36:47,300
Yes, and very useful.

847
00:36:47,300 --> 00:36:50,180
Let's do another scenario, team meeting.

848
00:36:50,180 --> 00:36:51,060
Great.

849
00:36:51,060 --> 00:36:52,460
Good afternoon, everyone.

850
00:36:52,460 --> 00:36:54,020
Thank you for joining.

851
00:36:54,020 --> 00:36:56,020
I'd like to share an update.

852
00:36:56,020 --> 00:36:57,100
Go ahead.

853
00:36:57,100 --> 00:36:59,260
We've completed phase one.

854
00:36:59,260 --> 00:37:01,260
That's great progress.

855
00:37:01,260 --> 00:37:03,860
However, we've encountered a delay.

856
00:37:03,860 --> 00:37:05,020
I understand.

857
00:37:05,020 --> 00:37:06,620
What's the solution?

858
00:37:06,620 --> 00:37:08,580
We're working on resolving it.

859
00:37:08,580 --> 00:37:09,300
Excellent.

860
00:37:09,300 --> 00:37:10,700
Keep me updated.

861
00:37:10,700 --> 00:37:14,780
Now let's do one more email conversation style.

862
00:37:14,780 --> 00:37:15,980
Good idea.

863
00:37:15,980 --> 00:37:16,820
Hi, Daniel.

864
00:37:16,820 --> 00:37:18,540
I hope you're doing well.

865
00:37:18,540 --> 00:37:19,040
Hi, Emma.

866
00:37:19,040 --> 00:37:20,580
Thanks for your message.

867
00:37:20,580 --> 00:37:23,100
I'm writing regarding the report.

868
00:37:23,100 --> 00:37:23,620
Sure.

869
00:37:23,620 --> 00:37:24,740
What do you need?

870
00:37:24,740 --> 00:37:27,380
Could you please send the final version?

871
00:37:27,380 --> 00:37:28,020
Of course.

872
00:37:28,020 --> 00:37:29,540
I'll send it shortly.

873
00:37:29,540 --> 00:37:31,500
Thank you, I appreciate it.

874
00:37:31,500 --> 00:37:32,660
You're welcome.

875
00:37:32,660 --> 00:37:35,980
Before we finish, let's give some final tips.

876
00:37:35,980 --> 00:37:38,060
Keep your language simple.

877
00:37:38,060 --> 00:37:39,500
Be polite.

878
00:37:39,500 --> 00:37:41,100
Listen carefully.

879
00:37:41,100 --> 00:37:43,420
And practice every day.

880
00:37:43,420 --> 00:37:46,940
Communication is a skill that improves with use.

881
00:37:46,940 --> 00:37:50,540
The more you practice, the more confident you become.

882
00:37:50,540 --> 00:37:52,780
Now here's a question for you.

883
00:37:52,780 --> 00:37:56,140
What workplace phrase do you use most often?

884
00:37:56,140 --> 00:37:59,100
Try using one new phrase today.

885
00:37:59,100 --> 00:38:01,500
Thank you so much for joining us.

886
00:38:01,500 --> 00:38:03,460
Keep learning and keep improving.
